    "prompt": "Design a circular CD label with a vibrant red background. In the center, place large chrome-style text reading {argument name=\"album title\" default=\"Starlight Dreams\"}. Above this, add smaller white text: {argument name=\"top tagline\" default=\"A BRIGHTER TOMORROW SOUNDS LIKE YOU\"}. To the left of the center hole, include a glossy pink heart encircled by a transparent ring, resembling a planet. Below the heart, list these phrases in small white font: {argument name=\"left tracklist\" default=\"SAME SKY NEW DREAMS BIGGER TOMORROWS\"}. On the right side, depict a stylized female face in profile looking upward, rendered in glowing pinks and blues with digital star accents on her cheek. She wears futuristic headphones. Above her head, place a globe icon and the text: {argument name=\"right tagline\" default=\"A FUTURE FULL OF COLOR\"}. At the bottom center, show a crystalline cityscape inside a bubble floating on water, with the text above it: {argument name=\"bottom tagline\" default=\"LOVE BEYOND THE STARS\"}. Finally, at the very bottom edge, include the standard 'Compact Disc Digital Audio' logo.",
