    "prompt": "Create a sophisticated vertical editorial watercolor poster using the uploaded reference photo as the exact visual reference for the woman’s facial features, identity, hairstyle, skin tone, and overall appearance. IMPORTANT: This must be visually different from the original photo by transforming it into a hand-painted masterpiece. The subject is a young woman with long dark brown hair, wearing a black blazer over a white collared shirt, sitting in a relaxed pose with her chin resting on her right hand. She wears a wristwatch on her left wrist. The background should feature soft, abstract watercolor washes of beige and grey, suggesting a blurred cityscape or architectural elements behind her. Include delicate botanical watercolor accents (branches/leaves) on the left side. Typography: At the top center, large elegant script text reading 'Alina Ai' in brown. Below that, small spaced-out serif text 'PEOPLE ALWAYS STAY'. On the middle left, small stacked text 'A KINDER BRIGHTER ME'. On the upper right, small stacked text 'SAME GIRL DIFFERENT DREAMS'. On the lower right, small stacked text 'GOOD IDEAS BRIGHTER DAYS'. The overall aesthetic is clean, minimalist, artistic, and high-fashion.",
