    "title": "古典地中海宫廷花园",
    "description": "一幅 16:9 的古典油画风格场景，描绘了郁郁葱葱的地中海别墅花园，画面由大理石柱、雕像、喷泉和湛蓝的天空构成。",
    "prompt": "Create a grand romantic Mediterranean palace garden in an idealized classical oil-painting style, wide landscape composition. The scene is framed by two enormous fluted Corinthian columns at the far left and far right, with ornate gilded capitals, cream marble bases, climbing white flowers and green vines. On the left foreground, place a full-body ivory marble statue of a graceful robed classical woman holding or surrounded by white blossoms; on the right edge, show only part of another ivory statue beside a hanging golden chain or swing detail. The center should open into a vast brilliant {argument name=\"sky color\" default=\"cobalt blue\"} sky with painterly brush texture and scattered glowing cumulus clouds, leaving a large open sky area in the upper middle. Below, depict terraced formal gardens with dark cypress trees, manicured hedges, urns, steps, and two symmetrical splashing fountains in the lower foreground. In the middle distance, place an elegant sunlit {argument name=\"palace style\" default=\"Italian Renaissance villa\"} on a hillside, with warm ochre walls, arches, balconies, balustrades, and statues. Add tiny human figures in {argument name=\"accent clothing color\" default=\"royal blue\"} walking along the garden paths for scale. In the far background, include hazy blue mountains and a glimpse of a lake or sea. Lighting is warm golden afternoon sunlight, luxurious, serene, heavenly, highly detailed, painterly, with soft atmospheric perspective, ornate marble-and-gold classical architecture, lush greenery, white flowers, and no visible text or watermark. Use a cinematic 16:9 aspect ratio with the composition drawing the eye from the columns and fountains toward the palace and open sky.",
