    "title": "日式漫画草稿分镜页",
    "description": "生成一张带有戏剧性对话、嵌入式角色分镜以及用于漫画布局探索的亮粉色规划标记的黑白日式漫画分镜（Name）页。",
    "prompt": "Goal: Create a rough Japanese manga storyboard/name page in black and white with hot-pink editor-style sketch marks overlaid, as if planning an action scene in GPT Image 2.5.\n\nCanvas: Vertical manga manuscript page, portrait orientation, white background, thin black panel borders, monochrome art with vivid neon pink rough layout lines. Use dramatic Japanese manga pacing with large sound effects and vertical speech balloons.\n\nLayout: Use exactly 4 main visible manga areas plus 2 small inset cutaway panels. The page is divided into: 1 large top-left action panel taking about the left half and upper-middle page, 1 top-right reaction/dialogue panel, 1 lower-left small tilted inset panel, 1 lower-right small tilted inset panel, and an open lower central white space containing big dialogue balloons and a pink arrow gesture. Add irregular panel angles and thick black dividing lines.\n\nMain panel details: In the large top-left panel, show a crude hot-pink stick-figure runner with an oversized circular head and simple limbs, leaning forward and sprinting. Surround the runner with exactly 6 large distressed black Japanese sound-effect marks reading like 「ド」 and 「ドド」, plus a huge vertical bold shout on the left: 「ぶちかます!!!」 and a smaller vertical line near the center: 「まっすぐ行って!」. The action should feel forceful and unfinished, like a manga name draft with placeholder anatomy.\n\nTop-right panel details: Show an almost empty room-like rectangular space with a simple wall line and two hot-pink circular placeholder heads connected by a diagonal line, implying two characters watching. Include exactly 2 vertical speech balloons: one upper balloon reading 「こんなもの……」 and one lower balloon reading 「作戦でも論理でもないことは百も承知だが」. Add exactly 2 small jagged reaction/SFX boxes between the heads, one with a short surprised mark and one with scratchy katakana-style noise.\n\nLower section details: Place exactly 2 large vertical speech balloons in the open lower half. The right balloon reads 「冷静沈着なデータキャラが…」. The center balloon reads 「仲間のためにデータを捨てる展開…!!」. Draw a long hot-pink arrow/body line starting from a large pink circle at lower left and pointing toward the small lower-right inset, with a small black sound effect near the arrow reading 「ゲホッ」.\n\nInset panels: Include exactly 2 grayscale character inset panels. The lower-left tilted inset shows a serious anime woman with long hair and glasses adjusting her glasses, shaded with clean manga hatching, with a vertical caption reading 「バカバカしい根性論など無駄だ」. The lower-right tilted inset shows the same glasses-wearing woman near charts or data displays, speaking in a balloon that reads 「戦いはデータだよ」. The character should look analytical, calm, and data-focused.\n\nVisual style: Rough manga storyboard/name, energetic black ink, thick distressed lettering, clean speech balloons, unfinished hot-pink construction lines, minimal backgrounds, high contrast, Japanese weekly manga draft aesthetic. Keep the pink sketch marks visibly on top of the final page art, like an editor's planning layer.\n\nParameters: The analytical character is {argument name=\"character name\" default=\"the glasses-wearing data strategist\"}; the main vertical shout is {argument name=\"main shout text\" default=\"ぶちかます!!!\"}; the action instruction is {argument name=\"action instruction text\" default=\"まっすぐ行って!\"}; the central payoff line is {argument name=\"payoff dialogue\" default=\"仲間のためにデータを捨てる展開…!!\"}; the overlay sketch color is {argument name=\"sketch color\" default=\"hot pink\"}.\n\nConstraints: Preserve the exact counts: 4 main visible manga areas, 2 inset panels, 2 grayscale character cutaways, 2 top-right speech balloons, 2 lower speech balloons, 6 large action SFX marks in the top-left panel. Do not add color except the hot-pink sketch layer. Do not add a watermark or page number.",
