    "description": "用于生成宁静文化海报的提示词，以传统水墨风格呈现北京胡同建筑，并搭配诗意排版。",
    "prompt": "Create a horizontal 16:9 digital poster in a traditional Chinese ink wash painting style, featuring a warm red and beige color palette. The composition is framed by two massive, textured vermilion walls on the left and right edges, creating an alleyway perspective leading into the distance. \n\n**Left Wall:** Features a large white Chinese character \"北\" (Bei) at the top with small English text \"B E I J I N G\" below it. A traditional tiled roof corner protrudes from the wall. Vertical text reads \"一座古老的城 / 依然温柔地生活着\" alongside a red seal stamp containing the characters \"北京\".\n\n**Right Wall:** Features a large white Chinese character \"京\" (Jing) at the top with vertical English text \"A MORE HUMAN CITY\" beside it. A traditional wooden gate with a hanging red lantern and a branch of yellow autumn leaves are attached to this wall. Vertical text reads \"平凡的日子 / 也很珍贵\".\n\n**Center Scene:** A misty, pale beige street stretches into the distance towards a faint silhouette of a traditional city tower (resembling the Drum Tower or Qianmen). In the middle ground, a solitary figure wearing a dark coat and orange scarf pushes a tricycle cart away from the viewer. Several black birds fly in the sky near a soft orange sun.\n\n**Typography & Layout:**\n- **Top Header:** Small black text centered at the very top: \"2026-10-06 / 早安 北京 / ● / GOOD MORNING / 城市人文\".\n- **Center Overlay:** Elegant golden cursive script reading \"good morning\" overlays the center of the image. Above it, vertical columns of black Chinese text read: \"今日金句：/ 慢下来，听见城的心跳。/ 晨光穿过城墙，/ 日常自有回声。\"\n- **Bottom Footer:** A row of spaced-out English words along the bottom edge: \"BEIJING HUTONG DAWN CITY WALK HUMANITY TODAY'S QUOTE\".",
