    "description": "展示四个不同设计的 CD，均置于透明珠宝盒中，涵盖全息贴纸艺术、金属金色、花卉摄影及迷幻漩涡风格。",
    "prompt": "Generate a high-resolution image of four distinct CD/DVD discs housed in clear, glossy plastic jewel cases arranged in a 2x2 grid. \n\nTop-Left Disc: A vibrant 'sticker-bomb' aesthetic on a holographic rainbow background. It features multiple colorful stickers including text like 'TypingMind MOTION', 'You're ABSOLUTELY RIGHT', 'AGI IS COMING', and 'EMOTIONAL AI SUPPORT'. Other elements include a disco ball, a Red Bull can, a laptop with a smiley face, hearts, stars, and a checkered flag.\n\nTop-Right Disc: A sleek, brushed gold metallic surface featuring minimalist white line-art diagrams resembling technical schematics or circuit board traces.\n\nBottom-Left Disc: A photorealistic, deep red rose bloom centered against a solid black background.\n\nBottom-Right Disc: A psychedelic, swirling galaxy pattern with iridescent colors (pinks, blues, purples) and star-like sparkles.\n\nAll discs have standard central hubs with silver rings and are encased in transparent plastic boxes with visible hinges and corner details.",
