    "description": "一份详细的提示词，用于生成一个全面的径向时间轴信息图，可视化展示从 1943 年到 2025 年的人工智能发展历史。",
    "prompt": "Create a high-density, professional infographic titled \"A History of Artificial Intelligence — Information Visualization\" (人工智能发展史). The design should be a chronological radial atlas covering the years 1943–2025.\n\nLayout and Structure:\n- Top Header: Large title text in Chinese and English. Subtitle: \"From Logic to Generation & Reasoning 1943—2025\".\n- Left Sidebar: A vertical list of six editorial phases (01 Foundations, 02 Symbolic Exploration, 03 Knowledge & Learning, 04 Data & Deep Learning, 05 Deep Learning Breakthroughs, 06 Generation & Reasoning), each with a small circular icon and year range.\n- Central Visual: A complex concentric ring chart (radial timeline) representing decades from the 1940s to the 2020s. \n- Radial Labels: Numerous AI milestones arranged along the rings, connected by lines to their specific years. Examples include: McCulloch-Pitts Neuron, Turing Test, Perceptron, Expert Systems, Backpropagation, AlexNet, GANs, Transformers, AlphaGo, BERT, GPT series, Stable Diffusion, ChatGPT, Sora, and Llama.\n- Color Coding: Use a palette of muted earth tones (terracotta, beige, dark brown, grey) to differentiate between categories like Theory, Models, Applications, and Infrastructure.\n- Bottom Section: Two data visualization panels. Left panel shows a bar chart of milestone distribution by decade. Right panel uses nested circles to show the composition of nodes by category (Theory, Model, Application, Infrastructure).\n\nStyle: Minimalist, academic, clean typography, high information density but legible. White background.",
