    "prompt": "Transform the reference photograph into a sophisticated minimalist editorial art poster while preserving the original café interior, wooden tables, chairs, plants, lighting, and composition. Create a refined architectural illustration with translucent geometric overlays, soft pastel gradients, warm cream and beige tones, muted sage green, pale blue, and golden yellow. Use delicate grid lines, subtle paper texture, elegant negative space, and soft sunlight for an artistic, contemporary design-magazine aesthetic. Arrange the result as a vertical split composition, with the realistic photograph on top and an abstract artistic reinterpretation below. Add subtle typography reading “{argument name=\"main_text\" default=\"A QUIETER DAY\"}” and “{argument name=\"sub_text\" default=\"SAME PLACE, BRIGHTER THOUGHTS.\"}” Premium graphic design, minimalist Swiss editorial layout, soft atmospheric glow, balanced composition, high detail, 4K quality, portrait 4:5 aspect ratio.",
