    "title": "45 格人像摄影联系表",
    "description": "一个用于生成包含 45 张亚洲女性多样化人像缩略图的全面网格提示词，并带有技术文件命名叠加层。",
    "prompt": "Goal: Generate a single composite image displaying a grid of 45 distinct portrait photographs, numbered sequentially from 01 to 45.\nCanvas: A large digital contact sheet layout with a dark grey background. The images are arranged in a dense grid (approximately 11 columns by 5 rows).\nSubject details: Each thumbnail features a young Asian woman in a high-quality studio or environmental portrait style. The subjects vary in clothing (casual t-shirts, blazers, traditional qipao, dresses) and lighting (soft window light, dramatic rim light, flat studio light). Most poses are head-and-shoulders or waist-up shots facing the camera or slightly angled.\nText content: Below each individual thumbnail is a small white filename label. The format is strictly \"[Number]-P_模块化写真.png\" followed by the resolution \"1536 x 2048\" on a second line. For example, the bottom-left image is labeled \"05-P_模块化写真.png\". Some labels in the fourth row use variations like \"S1-D_直闪语法对照.png\" or \"01-A_关键词链.png\".\nVisual style: Photorealistic, clean, professional photography portfolio aesthetic. High definition faces, natural skin textures without heavy grain.",
