    "description": "一款写实风格的宣传海报设计，专为桂花龙井风味冰拿铁打造，包含优雅的排版和产品细节。",
    "prompt": "Create a high-resolution vertical food photography poster for an autumn coffee special. The central subject is a close-up of a glass cup filled with a layered iced latte, featuring rich brown coffee and swirling white milk at the bottom, topped with a thick layer of creamy foam. Sprinkle small golden osmanthus flowers generously over the foam surface. The background is a soft, out-of-focus beige/cream color with blurred hints of yellow flowers in the upper left corner. Overlay the image with specific typography: Top header row (small text): '秋季新品 AUTUMN SPECIAL', '桂花 x 龙井 x 奶咖 OSMANTHUS x LONGJING x COFFEE', '杭州风味 HANGZHOU INSPIRED', '一杯好喝的季节 A CUP OF GOOD SEASON', 'GOOD COFFEE BETTER DAYS'. Upper right quadrant: Large sans-serif English title 'OSMANTHUS LONGJING' followed by smaller text 'A CUP OF OSMANTHUS FROM WEST LAKE FALLS INTO LONGJING FRESHNESS'. Center overlay: Huge, bold white Chinese characters '满陇桂雨' spanning across the middle of the drink. Below that: White English subtitle 'OSMANTHUS SWEETNESS MEETS LONGJING BREEZE'. Bottom left: Two paragraphs of small white Chinese text describing the flavor profile ('一杯西湖桂花落进龙井里的清香...' and '桂花的甜，龙井的清...'). Bottom right: Brand logo text '咖啡胖胖王' with 'GOOD COFFEE BETTER DAYS' underneath.",
