    "prompt": "Hyper-realistic IMAX-level Netflix-style cinematic black-and-white romantic seaside photograph, 9:16 vertical. Use the uploaded image as the primary visual reference and preserve the exact facial identity, proportions, and defining features. Create a couple sitting together in shallow seawater, the woman wearing a loose white long-sleeve shirt with a simple light-colored short damage jeans, while the man wears a plain light short-sleeve crew-neck T-shirt with dark trousers, the woman seated sideways across the man’s lap and leaning her upper body toward him, her torso turned directly toward his face, one arm wrapping around his neck while her hand gently supports the back and side of his head, her other hand resting along his jaw and neck, her legs folded naturally across his lap with her lower legs extending through the shallow water, while the man sits upright and slightly reclined with one arm securely around her waist and his other arm lowered into the water for support, their faces very close together with their noses touching and lips gently meeting in a natural kiss, both eyes softly closed, the woman’s eyebrows relaxed, cheeks calm and lips naturally shaped into the kiss, while the man’s face remains relaxed with closed eyes and a gentle intimate expression, the woman’s long straight wet dark hair slicked naturally backward with damp strands falling loosely over her shoulders and back, while the man has short wet dark hair brushed naturally backward with slightly uneven strands, natural realistic skin texture with soft wet highlights, surrounded by shallow rippling seawater, dark rugged coastal rocks and a cloudy overcast sky, soft diffused daylight falling evenly across the couple with subtle highlights on their wet hair, faces, shirts and water droplets, monochrome black-and-white grading with deep charcoal shadows, bright silver highlights, soft gray midtones, restrained contrast, fine film grain and a timeless cinematic documentary feel, keeping the water, rocks, clothing and skin clearly separated through controlled tonal depth.\nNegative prompt: changed identity, distorted anatomy, extra limbs, fused hands, deformed fingers, incorrect leg placement, unnatural pose, duplicated features, text, watermark.",
