    "description": "一个用于生成电影感海滩情侣人像的提示词，在黄金时刻拍摄，并利用参考图像保持人物身份特征。",
    "prompt": "Hyper-realistic IMAX-level Netflix-style cinematic golden-hour beach couple portrait, 9:16 vertical. Use the uploaded image as the primary visual reference and preserve the exact facial identity, proportions, and defining features. Create a woman and a man, the woman wearing a white fitted tank top, a loose beige knitted cardigan, light blue damage and rough jeans and white sneakers, while the man wears a plain black T-shirt, beige trousers and a wristwatch; the woman is seated securely on the man’s shoulders with her legs resting down on either side of his upper body, her knees naturally bent and feet hanging forward, while the man walks barefoot toward the camera with an upright balanced posture and both hands gently holding her lower legs for support; the woman stretches both arms widely upward and outward in a joyful V shape, palms open and fingers naturally separated, her chest lifted slightly, head tilted back and turned a little toward the left with eyes softly closed and a broad genuine smile, while the man looks slightly upward toward her with a relaxed happy smile; the woman has long dark brown hair flowing freely behind her and across her shoulders, with loose windblown strands moving toward the left; both have natural realistic skin texture with soft warm sunset highlights; they are walking along the edge of a beach with shallow waves on the left, wet reflective sand beneath them, a distant coastal city skyline and mountains on the right, and numerous seagulls flying across the sky; the low setting sun sits near the ocean horizon behind them, creating strong golden backlight, glowing rim light around the woman's hair and cardigan, warm highlights along both figures and bright reflections stretching across the wet sand, while soft ambient light keeps their faces clearly visible; rich cinematic golden-orange colour grading with warm amber sunlight, soft peach clouds, muted blue ocean and sky, natural beige sand, controlled contrast, slightly warm white balance, luminous sunset highlights, deeper but soft shadows, subtle atmospheric haze, gentle filmic bloom and smooth highlight roll-off, creating a joyful romantic travel-film atmosphere with realistic depth and natural colour separation. \n\nNegative prompt: changed identity, distorted faces, deformed hands, extra fingers, incorrect shoulder pose, floating limbs, bad anatomy, unnatural balance, flat lighting, excessive saturation, text, watermark.",
