    "description": "一个详细的提示词，用于创作一位女性打台球的超写实 IMAX 风格电影感肖像，强调从参考图像中保留人物身份特征以及特定的灯光/色彩分级。",
    "prompt": "Hyper-realistic IMAX-level Netflix-style cinematic billiards portrait, 9:16 vertical. Use the uploaded image as the primary visual reference and preserve the exact facial identity, proportions, and defining features. Create a woman wearing a fitted bright-red sleeveless dress with thin shoulder straps and a delicate silver necklace with a small blue pendant. She leans forward over a green-felt pool table, her torso angled toward the camera and her shoulders lowered into a focused playing stance. Her left arm extends across the table, palm down with fingers spread to form a bridge beside the yellow cue ball, while her right hand grips the wooden cue near the opposite side, guiding it diagonally toward the ball. Her head stays slightly lowered while her eyes look directly at the camera beneath gently relaxed brows; her lips are closed with a subtle, serious expression. Her long, dark-brown hair has a centre part and falls in smooth, voluminous loose waves over both shoulders, with curved front sections framing her cheeks. Fair luminous porcelain skin with a bright ivory to light beige tone, neutral-cool undertones and natural realistic texture. A softly blurred indoor billiards hall fills the background with warm amber walls, indistinct patrons and muted green table surfaces. Warm overhead lighting creates gentle highlights on her hair and shoulders, while soft shadows shape her face and arms. Apply cinematic colour grading with rich emerald-green felt, vivid red clothing, warm amber-brown surroundings, controlled contrast, soft background bokeh and a subtle filmic finish. Keep the foreground cue ball and bridge hand prominent, with shallow depth of field drawing attention to her face and playing stance. \nNegative prompt: incorrect cue alignment, misplaced bridge hand, distorted fingers, malformed pool cue, unnatural anatomy, altered identity, plastic skin, text, watermark.",
