    "description": "一份全面的提示词，用于创建展示 iPhone 18 Pro 的高端、逼真科技信息图，包含技术标注和苹果风格的美学设计。",
    "prompt": "Create a premium, photorealistic 4K technology infographic showcasing the iPhone 18 Pro as the hero product.\n\nDesign a sleek, high-end editorial infographic with a minimalist Apple-inspired aesthetic, dark graphite/black background, subtle metallic gradients, soft studio reflections, and precise technical callouts.\n\nPlace a large iPhone 18 Pro vertically in the center, shown at a slight three-quarter angle with the front display and titanium-style frame clearly visible. Add a second smaller rear-angle view beside it to showcase the camera system.\n\nAround the phone, create clean infographic callouts connected with thin elegant lines and small technical markers. Highlight key features such as:\n\n• Pro-grade camera system\n• Advanced main camera sensor\n• Ultra-wide camera\n• Telephoto zoom\n• Next-generation A-series Pro chip\n• ProMotion high-refresh-rate display\n• Titanium-style premium frame\n• USB-C connectivity\n• Advanced computational photography\n• All-day battery performance\n• AI-powered photography and on-device intelligence\n\nUse clear, modern typography, strong visual hierarchy, restrained text, and realistic technical diagrams. Include subtle exploded-view details of the camera module and internal components without making the design look cluttered.\n\nAdd a refined title at the top:\n\n“iPHONE 18 PRO”\n\nSubtitle:\n“THE NEXT GENERATION OF PRO”\n\nAt the bottom, include a compact specification strip with categories such as:\nDISPLAY • CHIP • CAMERA • BATTERY • CONNECTIVITY\n\nVisual style: luxury technology advertising, premium product launch presentation, futuristic but believable, extremely clean composition, realistic materials, sharp details, controlled reflections, cinematic studio lighting, sophisticated black and silver palette, professional product photography, magazine-quality graphic design.\n\nAspect ratio: 4:5 vertical\nUltra-sharp, high-resolution, photorealistic, no unnecessary decorative elements, no messy geometry, no distorted phone geometry, no messy typography.",
