    "prompt": "A high-fidelity composite photograph composed of four distinct images of the same young South Asian woman. The structure is a quadrant collage with diagonal dividing lines surrounding a central, bottom-anchored color image.\n\nThe central, main color image is a medium shot of the woman facing forward with her hands pressed together in a traditional namaste gesture. She has long, wavy dark brown hair styled half-up with braids and adorned with white jasmine flowers (gajra). She wears an elegant cream-colored saree with intricate gold embroidery, heavy gold jhumka earrings, a matching gold necklace, and stacks of gold bangles on both wrists. Her expression is serene and smiling slightly, looking directly at the viewer. The background behind her is a soft-focus outdoor greenery setting.\n\nSurrounding this central figure are three black-and-white or desaturated portrait crops of the same woman:\n1. Top Left: A close-up portrait where she rests her chin on her hand, looking towards the camera with a gentle smile. White flowers are visible in her hair.\n2. Top Right: A profile view looking to the right, showing her ear with large jhumka earrings and flowers in her hair.\n3. Bottom Right: Another close-up similar to the top left but mirrored or slightly different angle, resting her chin on her hand, looking forward.\n\nSmall red heart emojis are floating near the top center intersection of the collage lines. The overall aesthetic is romantic, traditional, and polished, resembling a wedding or festival photo montage.",
