    "prompt": "A high-quality anime illustration of a beautiful young woman with long, flowing brown hair and large, expressive brown eyes. She is smiling warmly at the viewer while resting her chin on one hand. In her other hand, she holds a glass mug filled with an amber-colored beverage (like beer or tea) with ice and a lemon slice. She wears a sleeveless beige ribbed top with a patterned red and gold kimono-style jacket draped loosely off her shoulders. A small autumn leaf flower accessory is in her hair.\n\nShe is seated at a wooden table outdoors in a traditional Japanese garden setting during autumn. The background features lush green bamboo stalks and vibrant red maple leaves (momiji), with dappled sunlight filtering through the trees creating lens flares and bokeh effects.\n\nOn the table in front of her is a feast consisting of:\n1. A square wooden tray containing cold soba noodles topped with shredded nori seaweed.\n2. Two grilled rice balls (yaki-onigiri) with a dark soy glaze, served on a rectangular plate with pickles.\n3. A small ceramic bowl containing dipping sauce for the noodles.\n4. A small dish with grated daikon radish and green onions.\n5. A vase with red maple branches to the left.",
