    "title": "重庆晨间旅行海报",
    "description": "一款时尚精致的重庆旅行海报设计，融合标志性的长江索道、水彩风格城市景观以及双语排版艺术。",
    "prompt": "Create a high-resolution, horizontal travel poster for Chongqing, China, in an elegant 'Morning Aesthetic' style. The composition should feature a central focal point: a detailed illustration of the Yangtze River Cableway (a cable car) suspended on wires that stretch across the frame. \n\nBackground and Environment:\nThe background is a soft, watercolor-style wash blending misty mountain silhouettes with the modern skyline of Chongqing. Use a color palette of pastel purples, warm autumn oranges, and soft whites to evoke a serene morning atmosphere. Include subtle details like a suspension bridge in the distance and traditional architecture on cliff edges.\n\nTypography and Layout:\n1. Top Center: Large, bold serif English text \"CHONGQING\" stacked above \"GOOD MORNING\". Overlaying this is a handwritten red script reading \"rise above\".\n2. Below Title: Chinese text \"早安 重庆\" (Good Morning Chongqing) followed by the slogan \"翻过起伏，便见辽阔\".\n3. Left Side: Large vertical calligraphy characters \"重庆\" (Chongqing). Next to it, smaller text blocks: \"在起伏之间 看见更大的世界\", \"CHONGQING MORE THAN A CITY\", and the date \"2026-09-26\". At the bottom left, include location pin icons and small footer text about \"两江交汇\" (Two Rivers Meet).\n4. Right Side: Vertical text \"山城不止一面...\" at the top right. Near the cliff edge, large vertical characters \"重庆\" again. Floating near the river area, handwritten text \"江与山 总会相遇...\".\n5. Bottom Right: Handwritten quote \"向上的每一天 都是好风景\" and a QR code placeholder labeled \"发现更多重庆之美\".\n\nVisual Details:\nAdd scattered orange maple leaves falling through the air to enhance the seasonal feel. The lighting should be soft and diffuse, suggesting early morning fog.",
