    "prompt": "Use my uploaded photo as the face reference. 3:4 vertical. An iOS share sheet on a light grey background: top left reads \"1 Photo Selected\" with an \"Options >\" pill below it, a round X close button top right, then a horizontal carousel of three photo thumbnails, and a bottom row of app icons labeled \"AirDrop\", \"Messages\", \"Mail\", \"WhatsApp\". Center thumbnail: the man in reference, keeping his exact face, hairstyle and identity, sitting cross-legged on a grey couch with a blue gingham blanket, holding an iced matcha latte with a green straw, looking at the camera. He wears a black baseball cap with a white NY logo, thin round gold wire glasses, an oversized cream shirt with a grey knit sweater draped over his shoulders, wide black trousers, white socks and black leather penny loafers, with a red crochet drawstring bag at his feet. 3D pop-out effect: his cap breaks out above the thumbnail's top edge, and his loafers and the red bag spill out over the app icons below. Side thumbnails, partially cropped: the same man sipping a takeaway coffee on the left, and resting his chin on his hand beside a monstera plant on the right. Soft indoor daylight, realistic skin texture.",
