    "prompt": "Using the uploaded reference image, preserve the exact same face, identity, facial features, and natural skin texture of the subject in an early internet nostalgia visual concept. Combine editorial image-making with retro digital print aesthetics: halftone dot grid screen, Risograph grain, ink bleed, early GUI interface fragments, 8-bit pixel geometry, soft airbrush gradients, and stencil overspray texture. Build the layout with browser-window frames, pixel icons, loading bars, dialog boxes, folders, cursors, or chat-window shapes. Keep the composition graphic, layered, playful, and slightly imperfect, with a mix of analog print noise and primitive digital design. Dress the subject in an oversized chunky grey knit sweater with black oval sunglasses. Include an adorable fluffy grey-and-white kitten clearly. Use vintage cream, faded bubblegum pink, muted blue, charcoal black, and subtle beige tones.",
