    "description": "使用 GPT Image 2.5 生成超写实 IMAX 风格霓虹人像的详细提示词，主打蓝色与品红色灯光效果。",
    "prompt": "Hyper-realistic IMAX-level Netflix-style neon blue and magenta cinematic beauty close-up portrait, 9:16 vertical. Use the uploaded image as the primary visual reference and preserve the exact facial identity, proportions, and defining features. Create a woman wearing a simple dark top mostly hidden by the extremely tight framing; her head is tilted slightly toward her right shoulder and angled gently toward the camera, her face filling almost the entire frame, her neck naturally extended, while one hand is raised beside the right side of her face with the fingers softly touching near her cheek and jaw; her eyes are wide and directly focused on the camera with a strong confident gaze, upper eyelids slightly lifted, eyebrows naturally defined, lips visibly parted with the upper teeth subtly showing and the tip of her tongue gently visible between the lips, resting against the inner edge of the lower lip, creating the distinctive playful expression seen in the reference, with her jaw relaxed and facial muscles natural; her long dark-brown hair is loose and slightly tousled, with fine strands crossing the forehead, between the eyes and across the cheeks, while fuller sections frame both sides of her face and fall toward the lower edge of the frame; fair luminous porcelain skin with a bright ivory to light beige tone and a neutral-cool undertone, realistic pores and fine facial texture with a natural soft sheen; the background is almost completely dark and indistinct, keeping full attention on the face and hair; intense electric-blue light falls from above and along one side, creating vivid blue highlights through the hair and across the outer facial contours, while saturated magenta and pink light illuminates the opposite side, producing a dramatic blue and pink split-light effect across the eyes, nose, cheeks and glossy lips, with tiny cool reflections visible inside the eyes; deep cinematic colour grading built around electric blue, cobalt, violet, magenta and subtle pink skin highlights, rich blacks, strong controlled contrast, preserved shadow detail, glossy luminous highlights, slightly cool white balance, vivid clean saturation and a polished late-night editorial finish while maintaining realistic skin texture beneath the coloured lighting. \nNegative prompt: changed identity, distorted face, asymmetrical eyes, incorrect tongue placement, closed mouth, missing teeth, bad hands, extra fingers, artificial skin, excessive smoothing, flat lighting, text, watermark.",
