    "title": "秋季书店活动演示幻灯片",
    "description": "一款时尚大气的演示幻灯片设计，融合醒目的中文书法、银杏叶摄影与温暖的秋日色调，专为书店周年庆活动策划。",
    "prompt": "Create a high-resolution, professional presentation slide (16:9 aspect ratio) with an 'Autumnal Literary' aesthetic. The background is a clean off-white paper texture. \n\n**Visual Elements:**\n1. **Main Typography:** Large, expressive Chinese calligraphy in the center-left reading \"把秋天装进书店\" (Put Autumn into the Bookstore). The font style should be rough brush strokes in a burnt orange/terracotta color.\n2. **Geometric Shapes:** A large diagonal block of solid burnt orange cutting across the right side of the canvas from top-right to bottom-center.\n3. **Photography:** In the upper right corner, overlay a realistic photo of golden ginkgo leaves on a branch against a white wall, casting soft shadows. This image should blend naturally with the orange geometric shape.\n4. **Stamp Element:** A red circular stamp graphic in the top right corner containing the text \"五周年\" (5th Anniversary).\n5. **Secondary Text:** Below the main calligraphy, include smaller black sans-serif text: \"山海秋集\" and \"独立书店五周年企划路演\". Further down, add small grey text: \"五周年活动命题 / 秋日阅读市集\".\n6. **Decorative Details:** Add scattered single autumn leaves floating around the text. Include vertical English text on the far left edge: \"BOOKS PEOPLE A KINDER AUTUMN\". Include vertical Chinese text on the far right edge: \"书 · 人 · 秋天 · 更好的日常\". Bottom right corner has page number \"01 / 09\".",
