    "title": "YouTube 科技博主信息流对比",
    "description": "一张宽幅对比图，展示了两个用于科技博主视频推荐的 YouTube 深色模式主页模拟图，适用于 AI 图像模型的截图测试。",
    "prompt": "Goal: Create a wide black-background comparison graphic showing two generated YouTube home page screenshots for a tech-bro recommendation feed, comparing {argument name=\"left model label\" default=\"GPT-Image 2.5\"} versus {argument name=\"right model label\" default=\"GPT Image 2\"}.\n\nCanvas: Very wide 3:1 landscape image, approximately 1200×640 pixels. Use a pure black outer background with generous margins. Center the composition horizontally.\n\nLayout: Place exactly 2 large YouTube dark-mode browser screenshots side by side. The left screenshot sits in the left half and the right screenshot sits in the right half, with a clear gap between them. Above each screenshot, center a white model label in a clean sans-serif font. Under both screenshots, centered near the bottom, place one caption: {argument name=\"bottom caption\" default=\"A screenshot of Youtube home page for a tech bro.\"}\n\nLeft screenshot details: A dark-mode YouTube homepage mockup labeled GPT-Image 2.5. Include the YouTube logo at top left, a search bar along the top, sidebar navigation on the far left, and category chips across the top. Show exactly 12 visible video thumbnail cards arranged in a 4-column by 3-row grid. The thumbnails should look like startup, productivity, investing, AI, and self-improvement content. Include these 12 visible thumbnail themes: 1) “The next 10 years” with a young male tech founder portrait, 2) “How to Build a Startup in 2025,” 3) “A Calmer More Focused You” landscape/meditation thumbnail, 4) “ELON MUSK Full Interview,” 5) “M4 Worth it?” laptop thumbnail, 6) “Build a Second Brain” Notion-style thumbnail, 7) “S&P 500” green stock chart, 8) “Stop Scrolling. Build Something.” creator portrait, 9) “The Future of Work” scenic thumbnail, 10) “a day in my life” desk/window lifestyle thumbnail, 11) “Tech Products That Changed My Life” gadgets on table, 12) one additional tech/productivity card consistent with the grid. Use small channel avatars, view counts, durations, and metadata text, but keep most small text only partially legible like a real screenshot.\n\nRight screenshot details: A dark-mode YouTube homepage mockup labeled GPT Image 2. Include the YouTube logo, search bar, sidebar navigation, top category chips, and profile/create icons. Show exactly 8 visible video thumbnail cards arranged in a 4-column by 2-row grid. The thumbnails should be sharper and more spacious than the left panel. Include these 8 visible thumbnail themes: 1) “how I built this.” with a Shopify bag icon and founder portrait, 2) “The Era of AI Employees” with two men and AI icons, 3) “$0 to $1M ARR” black chart thumbnail, 4) “The Truth About Silicon Valley” with a man’s portrait, 5) “Hard Truths” with Elon Musk portrait, 6) “minimal. but effective.” desk setup thumbnail, 7) “$10K/MO SIDE PROJECT” with creator portrait and app icons, 8) “How Bitcoin Works” with Bitcoin icon network graphic. Add small video durations and metadata beneath each card.\n\nVisual style: Photorealistic screenshot-comparison aesthetic, crisp UI details, dark YouTube theme with charcoal panels, white and gray text, red YouTube accents, subtle thumbnail colors, realistic browser screenshot proportions. The overall graphic should look like a social media post or review image comparing two AI image models.\n\nConstraints: Do not add an AI Search video. Keep exactly 2 screenshots, exactly 2 top labels, exactly 1 bottom caption, exactly 12 video cards in the left screenshot, and exactly 8 video cards in the right screenshot. Avoid watermarks and avoid any extra explanatory text outside the specified labels and caption.",
