    "title": "将粗糙的分镜草图专业化",
    "description": "将粗略的火柴人分镜转化为精致、高戏剧性的漫画风格序列，包含详细的角色设计和动态效果。",
    "prompt": "Using the provided reference image, transform the rough stick-figure storyboard into a highly detailed, professional manga-style storyboard. Keep the original 6-panel layout and grid structure intact.\n\n**Visual Style:**\n- Convert all crude stick figures into polished, dynamic anime/manga character designs with proper anatomy and clothing (school uniforms, sports gear).\n- Apply heavy cross-hatching, speed lines, and dramatic shading to create a high-energy action atmosphere.\n- Maintain the black-and-white ink aesthetic typical of Japanese manga storyboards.\n\n**Panel-by-Panel Instructions:**\n1. **Panel 1:** Depict a broadcasting club member holding a microphone, shouting enthusiastically. Add background elements suggesting a school setting.\n2. **Panel 2:** Show a chaotic crowd of students from various clubs running forward in a stampede. Use motion blur and intense expressions.\n3. **Panel 3:** Illustrate a soccer player kicking a ball with force. The ball should have 'burning' or energy effects trailing behind it.\n4. **Panel 4:** A baseball player looking up in shock as the glowing soccer ball flies directly toward their face.\n5. **Panel 5:** A brass band member playing a tuba/sousaphone aggressively, creating visible sound waves that knock the baseball player down.\n6. **Panel 6:** A dramatic close-up of a Kendo club member wearing a mask (men) and hakama, posing heroically with a bamboo sword raised against a bright sunburst background.\n\n**Text & Layout:**\n- Preserve the Japanese text columns on the right side (Visual Image/Audio Memo), but refine the handwriting to look like neat storyboard notes.\n- Ensure the header includes the title \"部活動対抗棒倒し\" (Club Activity Stick Pushing Competition).",
