    "prompt": "Hyper-realistic IMAX-level Netflix-style cinematic red-and-blue neon night portrait, 9:16 vertical. Use the uploaded image as the primary visual reference and preserve the exact facial identity, proportions, and defining features. Create a woman wearing a simple fitted black crew-neck T-shirt with natural fabric folds, her upper body turned mostly away from the camera in a strong three-quarter back pose, one shoulder closer to the camera while her torso faces toward the opposite side, her neck naturally rotated back over her shoulder toward the lens, shoulders relaxed, arms hanging naturally down along her sides, with the composition focused mainly on her upper body and face; her expression is calm, serious and subtly confident, eyes looking directly toward the camera with slightly narrowed relaxed eyelids, naturally shaped brows, closed relaxed lips and a composed gaze; her hair is shoulder-length with a voluminous layered blowout, deep dark brown to black, lifted slightly at the crown and swept backward with soft textured strands and a few loose flyaways catching the rim light, framing the sides of her face and extending naturally to her shoulders; fair luminous porcelain skin with a bright ivory to light beige tone and a neutral-cool undertone, realistic skin texture with subtle natural highlights; a dark urban night environment with indistinct architectural structures and glowing lights far behind her, strong red illuminated vertical elements on one side and cool blue surroundings creating deep cinematic separation, foreground red light streaks and soft circular bokeh partially crossing the lower frame; intense red backlight and rim light tracing the outer edge of her hair, ear, neck and shoulder, a cooler blue frontal and side fill softly shaping the face and black clothing, with controlled shadow detail so the face remains clear without losing the dark mood, subtle red reflections on the black shirt and hair edges, strong warm-cool light contrast, deep blue-black shadows, saturated crimson reds, rich cobalt-blue ambient tones, restrained skin-tone warmth, high local contrast around the face, soft highlight roll-off, atmospheric neon bloom, shallow depth of field, cinematic bokeh and a polished high-contrast night-film finish.\nNegative prompt: changed identity, short hair, distorted face, deformed hands, bad anatomy, unnatural head rotation, flat lighting, washed-out colours, text, watermark.",
