    "description": "一张竖版信息图风格海报，展示了一只刺绣熊猫以及传统蜀绣针法的技术细节。",
    "prompt": "Goal: Create a vertical editorial poster showcasing {argument name=\"embroidery style\" default=\"Shu Embroidery (蜀绣)\"} featuring a giant panda.\n\nCanvas: Vertical 9:16 aspect ratio with a textured beige linen background. The entire central subject is rendered in high-fidelity embroidery, showing visible silk thread textures and stitching direction.\n\nLayout:\n- Top Left: Large black Chinese calligraphy title \"蜀绣\", followed by serif English text \"SHU EMBROIDERY\" and a smaller tagline \"川针巧绣 · 锦绣天府\".\n- Right Side: A vertical column of small text reading \"国家级非物质文化遗产\" and \"四大名绣之一（蜀绣）\", alongside a red seal stamp.\n- Center: A large, realistic embroidered panda holding bamboo stalks, surrounded by embroidered plum blossoms at the bottom left.\n- Bottom Left: Three square close-up detail shots stacked vertically, each labeled with specific stitch names.\n\nSections & Text Content:\n1. Detail Card 1: Label \"晕针 GRADATION STITCH\" with description \"色彩层次自然过渡\".\n2. Detail Card 2: Label \"施针 SHI STITCH\" with description \"纹理细腻 流畅生动\".\n3. Detail Card 3: Label \"打籽针 FRENCH KNOT\" with description \"点缀花蕊 立体饱满\".\n4. Footer Text: A paragraph titled \"工艺简介\" describing the history of Shu embroidery originating from Sichuan.\n\nVisual Style: Song Dynasty minimalist aesthetic, traditional craft documentation, macro photography of textile art.",
