    "prompt": "Create a realistic mockup of an iPhone screen displaying the iOS Photos app 'Memories' interface. The header shows the location \"Paris\" and date \"APR 12, 2026\" in bold black text against a white background. The main content is a collage of travel photos featuring a young woman with long brown hair wearing a black coat. \n\nThe layout consists of:\n1. A large hero image at the top: The woman smiling with her hand on her cheek, winking slightly, with the Eiffel Tower and a sunset over the Seine river in the background. A circular play button overlay is in the bottom right corner.\n2. A grid of smaller images below (3 columns x 3 rows visible):\n   - Row 1: Left: View from behind walking down a street towards Sacré-Cœur Basilica. Center: A croissant and latte art coffee on a table with a newspaper. Right: The woman drinking coffee wearing sunglasses inside a cafe.\n   - Row 2: Left: A classic Parisian street lamp glowing orange near a red \"METRO\" sign. Center: The woman taking a mirror selfie with an iPhone. Right: A sunset view of the Seine river and bridges.\n   - Row 3: Left: Close-up of the woman smiling with the Louvre Pyramid in the background. Center: The woman holding a bouquet of flowers outside a shop named \"Fleurs de Paris\". Right: View from behind of the woman looking at Monet paintings in a museum gallery.\n\nThe bottom navigation bar has four icons: Library, For You (highlighted in blue), Albums, Search. The status bar at the top shows time 9:41, signal bars, wifi, and battery.",
