    "title": "电影感雨夜森林场景",
    "description": "用于创建超写实电影感场景的提示词，描绘一位职业女性在恐怖雨夜森林中行走的画面，适用于恐怖风格视觉或情绪化人像。",
    "prompt": "Create an ultra-realistic cinematic scene of a professional young woman walking alone through a vast, deserted and terrifying forest during heavy rainfall.\n\nShe is wearing an elegant, premium designer-style formal suit with a sophisticated, professional look. She carries a simple black umbrella above her head as she slowly walks along a narrow, muddy forest path.\n\nThe forest is extremely dense, isolated and mysterious, with enormous ancient trees, tangled branches, thick dark green vegetation and faint mist covering the ground. Heavy rain falls continuously, with visible raindrops hitting the umbrella and wet leaves. Water droplets glisten on the foliage and small puddles reflect the dim light.\n\nThe atmosphere should feel eerie, lonely and suspenseful, as if she is completely alone deep inside an unknown forest. Subtle fog surrounds the trees, distant shadows disappear into the darkness, and the background feels endless and abandoned.\n\nUse dramatic cinematic lighting, cool muted tones, realistic wet textures, natural skin details, realistic fabric, volumetric fog, deep shadows, atmospheric depth and a slightly horror-inspired mood.\n\nThe woman should remain the clear focal point, walking naturally and confidently while holding the umbrella. Full-body composition, wide cinematic framing, photorealistic photography, highly detailed environment, realistic rain, 9:16 vertical composition, no text, no logo, no watermark.",
