    "description": "一个提示词，可将自拍照转化为超写实的街头艺术壁画，画面中巨大的用户拥抱迷你版的自己，周围环绕着社交媒体图标。",
    "prompt": "Create an ultra-realistic, cinematic full-body street portrait using the uploaded reference photo as the exact identity reference.\n\n1. Face & Character Identity: Preserve the real person's exact facial features, skin tone, and hairstyle from the reference image.\n2. The Miniature Effect: Generate a giant version of the subject in the background who is gently wrapping their arms around a smaller, life-sized version of themselves standing in the foreground (a self-hug).\n3. Outfit: Both versions of the character wear a red bomber jacket with black ribbed cuffs, a plain black t-shirt underneath, black cargo shorts, and white sneakers with blue accents.\n4. Background & Graffiti: Set the scene against a weathered grey concrete wall covered in vibrant blue paint splatters and drips. Include a large Facebook 'f' logo on the left side.\n5. Social Media Elements: Scatter various Facebook reaction icons across the mural, including blue thumbs-up buttons, red heart buttons, laughing face emojis, and notification bubbles showing a heart icon with the number '1'.\n6. Typography: On the right side of the wall, include bold graffiti-style text that reads \"LOVE YOURSELF FIRST\" in blue and white brushstrokes, accompanied by a small hand-drawn crown at the top right corner.",
