    "prompt": "A minimalist anime portrait illustration of Sarada Uchiha from Boruto, rendered in a striking two-tone palette of deep crimson red and pure white with bold black outlines. The character is shown from the chest up, facing forward with a calm, neutral expression. She has short, straight black hair cut in a bob style with bangs framing her face. She wears distinctive red-framed glasses over large eyes that display the Sharingan — three black tomoe arranged around a dark pupil on a red iris background. A white forehead protector (hitai-ate) with the Konoha leaf village symbol sits across her forehead, partially covered by her bangs. She wears a high-collared sleeveless red vest with a white zipper running down the center front, revealing bare shoulders underneath. The background is a solid flat crimson red matching her outfit, creating a seamless color-block effect. Thin clean line art defines all features with no shading or gradients, giving it a graphic poster aesthetic. A small handwritten signature reading \"playforge\" appears in light gray near the lower right side of the image.",
