    "description": "一个用于创作雨夜汽车人像的电影感提示词，画面中一位戴墨镜的女性透过起雾的玻璃被观察，同时保留上传参考图的身份特征。",
    "prompt": "Hyper-realistic IMAX-level Netflix-style cinematic rainy-night car portrait, 9:16 vertical. Use the uploaded image as the primary visual reference and preserve the exact facial identity, proportions, and defining features. Create a woman wearing a black leather jacket with a dark top underneath and black sunglasses, seated naturally inside a car and viewed from outside through the closed side window, her upper body upright in the seat with her shoulders slightly angled away from the window, her head gently turned toward the window and camera in a subtle three-quarter view, her face calm and composed with relaxed brows, a soft closed-mouth expression and a steady outward gaze behind the sunglasses, her dark brown medium-long hair worn loose with slightly tousled texture and a few damp strands falling naturally around her forehead and cheeks, fair luminous porcelain skin with a bright ivory to light beige tone and a neutral-cool undertone, natural realistic skin texture with subdued low-light highlights, the entire car side window forming a prominent foreground layer between the camera and the woman, the glass covered across the full frame including directly over her face with a thin layer of soft condensation and light fog, numerous large irregular rain droplets scattered densely across the glass, smaller droplets merging into thick vertical water trails, several partially blurred droplets sitting directly over the sunglasses, cheeks and hair area, creating visible optical distortion and soft diffusion while still allowing her facial features to remain recognizable, wet glass producing layered reflections of blue city lights and small warm orange highlights, dark car interior behind the glass, blurred nighttime city buildings and street lights beyond the vehicle, strong cool cyan and deep teal ambient lighting dominating the scene, soft blue illumination diffused through the fogged wet glass rather than directly illuminating the face, subtle warm amber reflections appearing as broken blurred patches through the rain, deep blue-black shadows, strong teal-blue colour grading, cool desaturated midtones, controlled blacks, restrained saturation, preserved natural skin colour under the blue light, soft bloom around distant lights, heavy atmospheric diffusion, shallow depth of field and fine cinematic film grain, with the wet fogged glass clearly separating the viewer from the subject. \n\nNegative prompt: crystal-clear window, invisible glass, clean glass around face, sharp face without glass distortion, dry window, sparse droplets, missing condensation, distorted face, changed identity, bad anatomy, text, watermark.",
