    "prompt": "A high-resolution, wide-format digital illustration in a cute anime chibi style depicting a cozy Japanese moon-viewing (Tsukimi) festival at night. Three adorable chibi characters are sitting on the wooden engawa (veranda) of a traditional house. On the left is a boy with messy dark blue hair and large blue eyes, wearing a beige knit vest over a blue shirt, holding a skewer of Hanami Dango (pink, white, and green). In the center is a boy with fluffy blonde curly hair and amber eyes, wearing a yellow tank top, also holding a dango skewer. On the right is a girl with long silver-white hair fading to pink tips and purple eyes, wearing a frilly white dress, holding a round white rabbit-shaped rice dumpling. Between them sits a small wooden crate filled with white Tsukimi dango. The veranda is decorated with tall stalks of susuki grass and a blue runner cloth featuring gold moon patterns. In the background, a massive, luminous full moon hangs in a deep blue starry sky, illuminating distant mountains and a village with warm glowing windows. A stone lantern glows softly on the left side among the grass. The lighting is warm and inviting, contrasting with the cool night tones.",
