    "description": "用于生成超写实、电影感竖版肖像的详细提示词，描绘一位女性在冬季山脉中驾驶雪地摩托的场景，并保留上传参考图像中的面部特征。",
    "prompt": "Hyper-realistic IMAX-level Netflix-style cinematic winter snowmobile action portrait, 9:16 vertical. Use the uploaded image as the primary visual reference and preserve the exact facial identity, proportions, and defining features. A woman rides a dark burgundy snowmobile through deep fresh snow, wearing a fitted, glossy burgundy-and-black winter riding jacket with a front zipper and deep V-shaped neckline, black fitted snow pants, black insulated gloves, and dark wraparound sunglasses. She sits firmly astride the snowmobile with her torso slightly leaned forward and angled toward the right side of the frame, both hands gripping the handlebars, her left arm extended forward toward the left handlebar while her right arm bends naturally at the elbow toward the opposite grip; her hips remain centered on the seat, legs positioned securely along the sides of the vehicle, and her upper body twists slightly as she turns her head over her right shoulder toward the rider behind her. Her expression is focused and alert, visible through the side angle beneath the sunglasses, with relaxed but purposeful facial muscles and a confident, adventurous demeanor. Long dark wavy hair streams dramatically backward toward the left from the forward motion and cold wind, with individual strands flying freely around her shoulders. Fair luminous porcelain skin with a bright ivory to light beige tone and a neutral-cool undertone, natural realistic texture with subtle cold-weather highlights. A man follows behind on a white snowmobile, wearing a light icy-blue fitted winter jacket with a fur-trimmed hood, dark pants, gloves, and reflective blue sunglasses, positioned smaller in the center-right background. The scene takes place on a wide snowy mountain trail surrounded by heavily snow-covered pine trees, with towering rugged snow-capped mountains rising behind them and airborne snow particles filling the atmosphere. Bright cold winter daylight comes from the upper left/front, producing crisp highlights on the snowmobile windshield, helmet-level surfaces, hair strands, clothing, and airborne snow, while soft blue shadows fall across the snow and vehicle, creating strong natural depth and motion. Cinematic cold-blue and steel-gray colour grading with deep icy blues in the sky and shadows, clean white snow, restrained cyan highlights, rich burgundy contrast on the foreground snowmobile and jacket, high micro-contrast, controlled highlights, slightly cool white balance, deep but detailed shadows, preserved natural skin tones, subtle atmospheric haze around the mountains, sharp foreground detail with progressively softer background depth, and a dramatic high-end winter action-film finish.\nNegative prompt: changed identity, distorted face, deformed hands or fingers, bad anatomy, incorrect riding pose, extra limbs, static hair, plastic skin, text, watermark.",
