    "description": "一张分屏电影海报，左侧是手持火鸡和泰迪熊的憨豆先生，右侧是持枪的终结者。",
    "prompt": "Create a premium cinematic character bible sheet for {argument name=\"character A\" default=\"MR BEAN\"} &amp; {argument name=\"character B\" default=\"THE TERMINATOR\"}. Use uploaded character sheets as strict visual reference for both characters. Do not change either's appearance.\nLAYOUT: Split screen VS format. Two halves divided by a central vertical \"VS\" graphic with red splatter effects.\nLEFT SIDE (Character A): {argument name=\"character A\" default=\"MR BEAN\"}. Style: British caricature, slightly awkward but heroic pose. Outfit: Brown tweed jacket, white shirt, red tie. Props: Holding a raw turkey in one hand and a teddy bear under the other arm. Background: Red splatter, silhouette of Big Ben and a London bus. Text: Large brush-stroke title \"{argument name=\"character A\" default=\"MR BEAN\"}\" at top left. Subtext below title: \"THE LEGEND / LONDON.\" Small text near bottom center: \"LONDON STREET MIDDAY NO ESCAPE.\"\nRIGHT SIDE (Character B): {argument name=\"character B\" default=\"THE TERMINATOR\"}. Style: Hyper-masculine, muscular physique, stern expression. Outfit: Black leather biker jacket (open), black fingerless gloves, sunglasses with glowing red eyes. Prop: Holding a silver pistol upright. Background: Red splatter, silhouette of ruined city buildings. Text: Large brush-stroke title \"{argument name=\"character B\" default=\"THE TERMINATOR\"}\" at top right. Subtext below title: \"I'LL BE BACK / THE MACHINE.\"\nBOTTOM BANNER: White banner across the bottom with bold red text: \"{argument name=\"character A\" default=\"MR BEAN\"} VS {argument name=\"character B\" default=\"THE TERMINATOR\"}\". Below that, smaller black text: \"THE MACHINE CAME FOR HIM. HE HAD A TURKEY.\"",
