    "prompt": "Hyper-realistic IMAX-level Netflix-style cinematic sunset beach portrait, 9:16 vertical. Use the uploaded image as the primary visual reference and preserve the exact facial identity, proportions, and defining features. Create a woman wearing a relaxed dusty-pink knitted sweater with a wide neckline slipping slightly off one shoulder, paired with light-blue distressed jeans featuring horizontal rips at the thighs and knees, rolled-up cuffs, and no shoes. She stands barefoot on the wet shoreline inside the reflection of a large, ornate oval antique-bronze mirror positioned upright in the sand. Her body faces slightly toward the camera, her weight resting on one leg, with her feet close together and one knee subtly bent; both hands rest casually inside her front jeans pockets, her shoulders relaxed and her head tilted downward toward a small black cat sitting beside her feet. Her eyes look affectionately at the cat, with softly lowered eyelids, relaxed brows and a genuine, gentle smile. Her long chestnut-brown hair falls in loose, voluminous waves over both shoulders, with a few windblown strands framing her face. Fair luminous porcelain skin with a bright ivory to light beige tone and a neutral-cool undertone, retaining natural realistic texture and delicate highlights warmed by the sunset. The black cat sits upright beside her, its body facing forward and its head tilted up toward her, wearing a small collar with a dangling gold-toned charm. Inside the mirror, a breathtaking golden sunset spreads across the ocean, with glowing orange clouds, rolling waves, dark coastal rocks and a shimmering path of sunlight across the wet sand. The mirror's thick vintage metal frame has intricate antique detailing and catches tiny points of golden light; the surrounding beach contains scattered pebbles, dark rocks and softly blurred golden reflections in the foreground. Use low, intimate camera positioning with a full-body composition, keeping the woman and cat clearly visible within the mirror's oval frame. Apply rich amber and honey-gold highlights, burnt-orange skies, deep chocolate-brown shadows and muted coastal blues, with warm backlighting outlining her hair, soft cinematic contrast, realistic water reflections and shallow depth of field. The overall finish should feel dreamy, intimate and nostalgic, with glowing sunset bokeh and a polished cinematic photographic texture.\n\nNegative prompt: altered identity, incorrect mirror reflection, distorted hands, deformed cat, extra limbs, unnatural pose, plastic skin, oversaturated colours, text, watermark.",
