    "title": "早安深圳：每日城市海报",
    "description": "生成深圳早安城市海报，融合晨曦天际线与地铁摄影、中英双语编辑排版、引言卡片、天气条及右侧每日行程侧边栏。",
    "prompt": "Goal: Create a vertical \"Good Morning Shenzhen\" daily city-poster infographic combining a real photograph with editorial typography.\nCanvas: Portrait poster, full-bleed photo background with text overlays and a right-side dark sidebar.\nLayout: Top-left large headline; top-right small poetic blurb; bottom-left quote card plus weather strip; right edge vertical black sidebar with date and itinerary list.\nSubject details: A modern glass-and-steel metro station interior (escalators, hanging wayfinding signs reading \"Shenzhen\", \"Line 1\") on the right half, opening onto a bright dawn view of the Shenzhen skyline across the bay on the left, with the sun low over the water. Several commuters walk along an elevated glass-railed skywalk; one man in the foreground wears glasses, earbuds, a backpack, and looks at his phone. Greenery hangs from the ceiling structure.\nVisual style: Cinematic morning light, teal-and-lime color grade, clean sans-serif Chinese/English mixed typography, high contrast between the luminous sky and the dark sidebar.\nText content: Preserve Chinese labels exactly as shown — big lime headline 「早安深圳」 with English \"GOOD MORNING SHENZHEN\" and subtitle \"CONNECTED AT DAWN\"; top-right block 「在这座 / 永远在线的城市 / 每一个清晨 / 都有新的连接」 with English \"A BRIGHTER SHENZHEN / A MORE CONNECTED TOMORROW\"; bottom-left card \"TODAY QUOTE 今日金句\" with 「新的一天，不必等风，先把自己接通。」; weather strip 「天气 WEATHER 晴间多云 24–30°C 南风 3级」 and 「日出 06:20 城市信号 明亮」; right sidebar date \"10 / 23 FRI 2025 OCT 23 FRI\" followed by five bulleted stops: 「南头古城 NANTOU ANCIENT TOWN 08:00 历史与新生在此相遇」「福田 FUTIAN 09:30 城市心跳高效运转」「深圳湾 SHENZHEN BAY 12:00 海风照见更大的未来」「华侨城 OCT 15:30 艺术让城市更温柔」「海上世界 SEA WORLD 19:00 灯光与海不止于此」; sidebar footer \"PEOPLE TECHNOLOGY CITY BAY TOGETHER SHENZHEN\".\nConstraints: Keep all listed text verbatim including Chinese characters, maintain the exact number of sidebar stops (five), no watermark.",
