    "prompt": "Goal: Create a cute, pastel-colored Japanese character sheet infographic featuring three distinct characters stacked vertically.\n\nLayout & Content:\n1. Top Section (Pink Theme): Features 'Azusa-chan', a girl with black hair in a side ponytail, wearing a white t-shirt and pink skirt. Include a large portrait on the left, three smaller turnaround poses (front, side, back) in the center, and a row of three facial expressions (smiling, surprised, winking) on the right. Below the expressions, show her belongings: a blue flower hair tie, pink sneakers, and a heart-shaped bag.\n2. Middle Section (Blue Theme): Features 'Koma-chan', a girl with short brown hair and an ahoge, wearing a navy t-shirt with a chick graphic that says 'Perfect' and denim shorts. Layout mirrors the top section: large portrait, three turnarounds, three expressions (laughing, excited, angry), and belongings: a plush chick, a star wand, and a backpack.\n3. Bottom Section (Yellow Theme): Features 'Tori', a round yellow chick mascot. Layout includes a large illustration, three small variations, three expressions (happy, dizzy, shocked), and belongings: a nest, a feather, and a ribbon.\n\nVisual Style: Use a soft, hand-drawn aesthetic with rounded fonts, pastel backgrounds (pink, light blue, yellow), and decorative elements like hearts, stars, and sparkles scattered throughout.",
