    "description": "生成一张极具戏剧性的 3x3 漫画风格朋克音乐拼贴画，包含两位常驻女性角色、日文文字、红色颓废风背景以及富有表现力的漫画分镜。",
    "prompt": "Goal: Create a high-energy manga/anime punk music collage featuring two young women in a gritty red-and-black graphic style, as if from a dramatic Japanese music video comic page.\n\nCanvas: Wide horizontal 16:9 image, divided into exactly 9 rectangular comic panels arranged in a 3 columns by 3 rows grid, with thick clean white gutters between panels. Use bold black ink outlines, flat cel shading, rough brush textures, red backgrounds, black graffiti strokes, and purple accent typography.\n\nMain characters: Show exactly 2 recurring female characters throughout the panels. Character 1 is {argument name=\"brown-haired woman\" default=\"a young woman with a short light-brown bob haircut, pale skin, wide intense eyes, wearing a plain white T-shirt and loose black pants\"}. Character 2 is {argument name=\"black-haired woman\" default=\"a young woman with long straight black hair and bangs, pale skin, sharp wide eyes, wearing an oversized gray hoodie and loose black pants\"}. Their expressions should be manic, deadpan, startled, bored, and confrontational depending on the panel. Keep their faces consistent across all panels.\n\nPanel count and layout: Include exactly 9 panels:\n1. Top-left panel: close-up of the brown-haired woman lunging toward the viewer with a huge foreshortened hand reaching out, frightened manic expression, red background with black brush marks, purple Japanese text 「あきさん」 near her.\n2. Top-middle panel: close-up of the black-haired woman turning over her shoulder in a gray hoodie, surprised eyes, red background, purple handwritten text 「みゆー」 and a simple purple crown doodle.\n3. Top-right panel: both women crouching toward the viewer with exaggerated foreshortened hands making framing gestures; the brown-haired woman grimaces and the black-haired woman stares intensely; add handwritten black English text in the corner reading {argument name=\"corner slogan\" default=\"Music makes us crazy\"}.\n4. Middle-left panel: black-haired woman in profile looking upward dramatically against a red industrial city skyline and black power-line silhouettes; vertical black label with white Japanese text 「まだ終わらない」.\n5. Middle-center panel: both women back-to-back, brown-haired woman facing left and black-haired woman facing right, a purple broken-heart shape behind them; black name labels with white Japanese text 「あきさん」 and 「みゆー」.\n6. Middle-right panel: brown-haired woman screaming into a handheld microphone, extreme emotional singing pose; black vertical labels with white Japanese text 「うるさい世界で」 and 「歌ってる」; add a purple crown doodle.\n7. Bottom-left panel: black-haired woman curled into her gray hoodie, glaring over her sleeve, purple chains crossing the foreground; purple vertical text 「見て見て見て」.\n8. Bottom-middle panel: both women sitting side by side on steps in a red urban alley, bored and exhausted poses with elbows on knees and faces resting on hands; red wall behind them with small handwritten black Japanese text 「ふたりでまだ行けるよ」 and a tiny crown.\n9. Bottom-right panel: extreme split close-up of both women’s eyes and partial faces separated by a jagged red lightning slash; include handwritten black Japanese text 「ずっと」 and a small crown.\n\nVisual style: Japanese seinen manga meets punk album cover, dramatic fisheye perspective, exaggerated foreshortening, nervous facial expressions, heavy black shadows, red dominant palette, white skin highlights, gray clothing, purple graffiti accents. The art should look hand-inked, chaotic, stylish, and slightly unsettling but polished.\n\nText constraints: Preserve the visible Japanese text exactly as written. Use only the specified text elements, no extra captions, no watermark, no speech bubbles. Make all lettering look hand-painted or manga-style.",
