    "prompt": "A vertical, high-resolution digital illustration in a cute, 3D-rendered anime style. The central subject is a young girl with large brown eyes and brown hair styled in an updo with floral accessories. She wears a vibrant orange kimono patterned with white flowers and red accents, along with traditional geta sandals. She is depicted 'popping out' of a smartphone screen held by her left hand, which displays a scenic view of a red torii gate and Mount Fuji. Her right hand holds a small, patterned drawstring pouch. \n\nThe background features a bustling Japanese street scene with traditional wooden buildings, hanging paper lanterns (one reading \"おでん\"), and cherry blossom trees under a bright blue sky with Mount Fuji visible in the distance. \n\nIn the foreground on a wooden table, there are several food items: a plate of assorted nigiri sushi, a bowl of green matcha tea with a bamboo whisk, a wooden crate labeled \"抹茶\", and a small dish of pink mochi. To the right of the phone stands a lucky cat figurine (Maneki-neko) and a polaroid-style photo showing a pagoda and Mount Fuji with the text \"JAPAN\". \n\nText overlays include a large, brush-stroke title \"JAPAN\" in black at the top left with a red sun circle behind it, accompanied by smaller English text \"Travel Discover More Happiness\" and a red stamp with the characters \"日本\". In the top right corner, there is Japanese text \"見つけよう 日本のかわいい 思い出\" with heart icons.",
