    "description": "一张详细的人物设计海报，描绘了希腊命运女神阿南刻（Ananke），她正编织着金色的命运之线。",
    "prompt": "Create a vertical cinematic poster illustration of {argument name=\"character\" default=\"Ananke, the ancient Greek goddess of necessity and fate\"}. She is a beautiful woman with long dark hair, wearing an elaborate golden crown shaped like an armillary sphere or astrolabe. Her dress is made of intricate gold chains and metallic fabric. She holds glowing golden threads that weave through the air, connecting to large celestial spheres in the background. The lighting is warm, golden, and ethereal, creating a sense of divine power.\n\nText Layout:\n- Top Left: Large serif title \"ANANKE\" in gold.\n- Below Title: Japanese text \"アナンケ\" followed by English subtitle \"GODDESS OF NECESSITY\".\n- Left Side (Vertical Column): A block of white Japanese text describing her lore. It reads: \"すべてを必然へと導く女神。抗うことのできない法則、避けられぬ運命そのもの。神々さえもその意志から逃れられず、世界の流れは常に彼女の手の中にある。見えざる鎖であらゆるものを結び、定められた終着点へと至らせる。それは冷酷な束縛ではなく、世界を成り立たせるための絶対なる必然である。\"",
