    "description": "四格漫画页面，描绘了一位红发女武士角色接受师父建议离开道场去探索世界的故事。",
    "prompt": "Create a vertical manga page layout consisting of four distinct panels arranged in a grid (top row split, middle row split, bottom full-width). The art style is high-quality anime/manga with cel-shading and vibrant colors.\n\n**Panel 1 (Top Left):** A dynamic close-up action shot of a young female samurai with long red hair tied in a ponytail. She wears a white kimono top and red hakama pants. She is swinging a katana aggressively towards the viewer's left. Large black Japanese onomatopoeia text 「ブンッ」 appears to the left of her sword. Behind her is a wooden dojo interior with a hanging scroll reading 「おは斬流」.\n\n**Panel 2 (Top Right):** An establishing wide shot of a rural village nestled among green mountains under a blue sky. In the foreground stands a traditional wooden building with a signpost reading 「おは斬流道場」. A speech bubble at the top right reads: 「小さな村の、そのまた片隅。」\n\n**Panel 3 (Middle Row):** Split into two sections. On the left, a medium shot of the red-haired girl looking back over her shoulder with a surprised expression, saying 「…外？」. On the right, an elderly master with white hair and a beard, wearing dark grey robes, stands with arms crossed inside the dojo. He speaks in two bubbles: 「斬奈。そろそろ、外へ出てみろ。」 and 「世界を見てこい。道場の中だけでは、学べんこともある。」 A sign behind him reads 「おは斬流」.\n\n**Panel 4 (Bottom Full Width):** A scenic outdoor shot. The red-haired girl walks away from the camera down a dirt path, carrying a large brown backpack and holding her sheathed katana. She looks back slightly with a determined smile, saying 「…わかった。行ってきます。」 In the background, the old master stands at the entrance of the dojo watching her leave. His speech bubble says: 「冒険者になって、世界を回ってこい。」 The setting includes lush trees, distant mountains, and a bright sky.",
