    "description": "用于生成逼真插画的提示词，将人物（基于附加参考图）与处女座符号融合，呈现金色能量与神圣几何美学。",
    "prompt": "A realistic illustration of the model in the attached image, preserving her face and expression. Retain the head from the background of the original image, with the {argument name=\"zodiac sign\" default=\"Virgo\"} symbol positioned at the top. The entire setting is suffused with a glow of {argument name=\"energy color\" default=\"golden\"} energy, luminous sacred geometry particles, and cosmic {argument name=\"nebula type\" default=\"golden nebulae\"}. Color palette: pure gold, neon amber, and deep black. High-resolution visual quality with a metallic finish.",
