    "prompt": "A masterpiece. Top quality. A high-quality travel log of an autumn trip, complete with photos. All text must be written in Japanese. Keep the word count low so the text doesn't get squished. \nTravel Destination: [旅行先].\nCharacter’s Name: \"[名前]\". \nCharacter: Depict the character’s appearance based on the reference image. Ensure the depiction is anatomically accurate and natural. The Character’s Attire:The character’s attire in the photos should match the travel destination and consist of autumn clothing the character would likely wear. If the character is not human or humanoid, determine whether to dress them based on their appearance. Composition: Depict, in order from top to bottom, the title, the travel log, and the outcome of the trip. Use an autumnal background that matches the character’s vibe.Title: “[Character’s Name]の秋の旅行記.”Photos: Select a more specific location within the [Travel Destination] and depict the character enjoying their trip there using photo-style illustrations. Be sure to include elements that evoke autumn in each photo. Vary the location and the character’s actions for each photo. Travel Log: Arrange the three photos in a random order. Scatter sticker-style mini-illustrations featuring motifs from [Travel Destination] or autumn in the empty spaces next to the photos. Travel Summary: The travel summary consists of the character’s overall impressions of the trip and the souvenirs they brought back. Describe the overall impressions in a memo-style format. For the souvenirs, draw mini-illustrations of them and include their names and brief descriptions.",
