    "prompt": "A realistic, low-light selfie taken with an old Nokia phone camera, featuring three anime-style female characters huddled closely together. The image has a grainy, noisy texture typical of early digital cameras. On the left, a character with long silver hair and purple eyes winks playfully while holding the camera arm extended. In the center, a smaller character with short light blue hair and purple eyes makes peace signs with both hands near her face. On the right, a character with long dark purple hair and purple eyes smiles gently while making a peace sign with one hand. They are wearing detailed fantasy costumes in shades of white, blue, and purple. The background is a blurry night scene with warm yellow lights reflecting on water and traditional Asian architecture silhouettes. Include the text 'NOKIA' in the top left corner and the timestamp '2024/10/26 20:37' in the bottom right corner.",
